1
00:00:04,087 --> 00:00:05,130
[Shin Yoo-il scandal]

2
00:00:05,255 --> 00:00:06,089
[Shin Yoo-il is
Dating a Guy?]

3
00:00:06,215 --> 00:00:06,757
["Isn't that a Fake?"]

4
00:00:06,882 --> 00:00:07,466
[Shin Yoo-il
the Shindecent!]

5
00:00:07,591 --> 00:00:09,191
[Gender doesn't matter
but Honesty does!]

6
00:00:12,471 --> 00:00:13,805
Have you been
waiting for me?

7
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:20,020
How could we not?

8
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:21,511
Our one and only actor

9
00:00:21,595 --> 00:00:24,774
has a scandal with
a superstar Shin Yoo-il!

10
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,859
I'm not sure

11
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:29,696
I heard some bad rumors
about this guy

12
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:31,227
His nickname is
"Shindecent"

13
00:00:31,311 --> 00:00:33,492
because he's
so indecent, right?

14
00:00:33,617 --> 00:00:35,227
Still, he's the best
brand in showbiz

15
00:00:35,311 --> 00:00:37,496
who's most wanted
by advertisers

16
00:00:37,621 --> 00:00:39,553
Thanks to him

17
00:00:39,637 --> 00:00:41,100
people are talking
about you, Hyesung!

18
00:00:41,124 --> 00:00:43,377
She's right
You should be grateful

19
00:00:43,502 --> 00:00:44,502
But ma'am…

20
00:00:46,213 --> 00:00:46,755
[President Goo]

21
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,520
It's the president
of Shin Yoo-il's agency

22
00:00:51,176 --> 00:00:53,178
Hello, sir

23
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:54,554
It's been a while

24
00:00:56,974 --> 00:00:58,892
Are you serious now?

25
00:00:59,017 --> 00:01:00,352
Okay, I got it

26
00:01:03,105 --> 00:01:04,145
They wanna
make it official

27
00:01:05,524 --> 00:01:06,524
What?

28
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,251
Have I kept you waiting?

29
00:01:26,211 --> 00:01:27,254
Yes

30
00:01:27,379 --> 00:01:28,839
for quite a long time

31
00:01:28,964 --> 00:01:30,090
Sorry

32
00:01:30,215 --> 00:01:31,383
I took the wrong train

33
00:01:32,634 --> 00:01:34,428
How could you
not recognize me?

34
00:01:35,554 --> 00:01:36,750
What about you?

35
00:01:36,834 --> 00:01:38,015
Did you recognize me?

36
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,391
Sure, I did

37
00:01:39,516 --> 00:01:42,019
You're Yoon Minhyung
in "My Crazy Family"

38
00:01:42,144 --> 00:01:43,144
Right

39
00:01:44,146 --> 00:01:45,814
I used to be well known
as that character

40
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:48,941
Let's date

41
00:01:51,194 --> 00:01:52,194
What?
